<title>USA: Cousins Properties Q4 net rises to $0.63.</title>
<headline>Cousins Properties Q4 net rises to $0.63.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.63		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net		 18,130		   5,429</p>
<p> Revs		18,342		   9,297</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  28,784		   28,109</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
